    <briefdescription>
<para>YOLOv8 ONNX object detection plugin. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Wraps an ONNX Runtime session loaded from a YOLOv8 export. When ONNX Runtime is not present at compile-time the plugin initialises successfully but every <computeroutput><ref refid="classthemis_1_1plugins_1_1image_1_1_y_o_l_ov8_onnx_plugin_1afd2f32972ed9b2958ffdba73acb27764" kindref="member">detectObjects()</ref></computeroutput> call returns an informative error result rather than crashing. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
